  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "portals in worlds, not dropped, are pretty useless because if you go in one, it will either create a public instance or an invite instance. \nwhen you enter a portal in a world, it should inherit the owner of the current instance, invite type, and region so you can seamlessly continue as normal, instead of digging through the world menus trying to find the world to make a proper instance",
